er civil liberties infringements or claims resulting from police misconduct; and (c) a list disclosing the following information relating to civil claims against police in each year from 2019 to 2024: (i) the number of civil cases brought against the Australian Federal Police or its members, (ii) the number of civil cases settled, (iii) the number of cases brought by current or former members, and (iv) the number of cases brought by citizens. Sue Lines The question is that general business notice of motion No. 573, standing in the name of Senator Shoebridge, be agreed to.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9340","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-08-15/1"}
